# The first run's walk through how much the window shows: one question at a time, each with two or
# three answers, in the setup window's Look step and in `Wormhole welcome`.

tailor-start = Where do you want to start?
tailor-zen = Zen
tailor-zen-detail = The terminal list and the terminal: its name and the splits on top, nothing else
tailor-balanced = Balanced
tailor-balanced-detail = { -brand } as it comes
tailor-everything = Everything
tailor-everything-detail = Every part shown: the whole title row, the status bar and the minimap

tailor-title-row = What should the title row show?
tailor-title-name = Just the name
tailor-title-name-detail = The terminal's name and the split buttons
tailor-title-path = Where you are
tailor-title-path-detail = Folder, branch and the terminal, with Open in… and the splits
tailor-title-everything = Everything
tailor-title-everything-detail = Also the agent's model and context, open ports and the pull request

tailor-off = Off
tailor-on = On

tailor-status-bar = A status bar along the bottom?
tailor-status-bar-off = Nothing under the terminal
tailor-status-bar-on = Branch, agents and the terminal's size along the bottom of the window

tailor-minimap = A minimap beside each terminal?
tailor-minimap-off = The terminal runs to its edge
tailor-minimap-on = An overview of the scrollback along the terminal's right edge

tailor-dividers = Lines between the columns?
tailor-dividers-off = The sidebar, the terminal and the panel meet without a line
tailor-dividers-on = A thin line between the sidebar, the terminal and the panel

tailor-panel = Should the right panel be open?
tailor-panel-closed = Closed
tailor-panel-closed-detail = Open it when you want it, with its button at the window's top right
tailor-panel-open = Open
tailor-panel-open-detail = What changed, and the panel's other tools, beside the terminal

tailor-tools = Which tools should the right panel have?
tailor-tools-few = Changes and usage
tailor-tools-few-detail = What changed in the repository, and the agents' plan limits
tailor-tools-all = All of them
tailor-tools-all-detail = Every tool the panel has, such as the history
